    "sections": {
        "description": "Summer Program Theme is designed with a clean structure and organized layout suitable for displaying schedules, activities, announcements, and event details. The theme includes responsive page sections that adapt smoothly across desktop, tablet, and mobile devices. It supports customizable banners, image galleries, testimonial sections, and content blocks for program information. The layout is built for easy navigation, helping visitors access important details such as dates, sessions, registration information, and updates. It also includes integration support for contact forms, social media links, and newsletter sections. Multiple typography and color settings allow flexible styling without affecting readability. The theme is compatible with modern browsers and follows standard coding practices for stable performance. Additional customization options are available through the theme customizer, allowing adjustments to headers, menus, widgets, and homepage sections without editing core files."
    },
